{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3642760/extras/c47df2e90aa23acf7ed3c24e530faab2.gif?t=1772658432\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3642760/extras/c47df2e90aa23acf7ed3c24e530faab2.poster.avif?t=1772658432\" class=\"bb_img\" alt=\"Humans &amp;amp; monsters face off\" /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Humans &amp; Monsters</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two factions clash throughout the campaign. Are humans and monsters destined to remain enemies, or could unexpected alliances emerge?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3642760/extras/cc3b06d561390cb8cda1dd9c860661ca.poster.avif?t=1772658432\" width=780 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3642760/extras/cc3b06d561390cb8cda1dd9c860661ca.webm?t=1772658432\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3642760/extras/cc3b06d561390cb8cda1dd9c860661ca.mp4?t=1772658432\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Assemble your army, prepare your spells</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover a growing roster of units and learn their roles in combat. Some possess unique mechanics that can completely turn the tide of battle. Support your army by  healing allies, converting enemies, resurrecting the dead or unleashing devastating offensive spells.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3642760/extras/204f332a2c5a310fd693dd29092c727e.poster.avif?t=1772658432\" aria-label=\"Campaign map\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3642760/extras/204f332a2c5a310fd693dd29092c727e.webm?t=1772658432\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Conquer Amelorn</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each campaign mission presents a new test of strategy. With shifting spells, limited unit choices, and unique gamemodes, every battle demands a different approach.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play 20+ challenging campaign missions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recruit over 15 units with distinctive abilities and mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unleash powerful spells to turn the tide of battle</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle across 4 distinct game modes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create and customize your own battles in Skirmish Mode</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3642760?t=1772658432","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3642760?t=1772658432","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3642760/9269c3db4dff5a99427894c9e2d2193c0ce9fc79/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772658432","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3642760/9269c3db4dff5a99427894c9e2d2193c0ce9fc79/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772658432","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3642760/extras/c47df2e90a